      "description": "A round black-and-white penguin with large bright eyes, a small golden beak, golden webbed feet and a striped scarf, based on the supplied coloring drawings."
    },
    {
      "id": "rainbow-scarf",
      "kind": "prop",
      "label": "rainbow scarf",
      "description": "A six-color striped scarf matching the colorful first drawing."
    },
